          you speed up by moving forward and slow down by drifting back. That simple idea comes with a big price tag. On
          23 November 2026 the cheapest real slatted trainer we found was SB Fitness&rsquo;s CT250 walking model at $1,095
          direct, the best-known home model, the Sole C80, was $2,099.99, and a TrueForm Runner could be specified up to
          $9,195. Every price on this page is from the maker&rsquo;s own store or the Amazon listing on the date shown;
          curved treadmill prices move a lot around Black Friday, so check on the day you buy.
        </p>

